      "id": "04c1d2d7f2fe6924",
      "source": "bookings.md",
      "locator": "text",
      "text": "full refund of the equipment booking fee. Cancellations less than 24 hours before the session start receive no refund. Exactly 24 hours before the session qualifies for a full refund. If the workshop cancels a session because equipment is unavailable, it refunds the full equipment booking fee regardless of notice. Refunds return to the original payment method within five working days. Membership fees and purchased materials are not refunded under this booking policy. ## Changes A booking cannot be transferred to another member. To change equipment, cancel the existing booking and create a new one. The cancellation timing rules still apply. The assistant cannot create, change, cancel, or refund bookings; it can explain the documented process only.",
